        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_972_2939.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Min <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründtlich</unclear> willig dienst, gunst unnd alles guts zuvor, er=
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sam</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">from</unclear>, vest, fürsichtig, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eersam</unclear>, wyß, insonnders
<lb n="3"/>günstig lieb herren unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gut</unclear> fründ. Üwer schryben, mir
<lb n="4"/>von wegen <persName resp="#ner">Barbara Kilchmannin</persName>, darinn ir unnder
<lb n="5"/>annderem vermelden, diewyl unser erbreht im <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-103" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Thurgöuw</placeName>,
<lb n="6"/>mit dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üweren</unclear> nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stime</unclear>, so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">künndend</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> die <persName resp="#ner">Kilchmennin</persName>,
<lb n="7"/>nebend üweren burgeren, nit zulassen, es welle dan aber
<lb n="8"/>das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gmainen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lannds</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erkent</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werden</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">das</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> soelichem
<lb n="9"/>glychem fal, die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üweren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">yetz</unclear> unnd zu <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">künfftigen</unclear> zyten,
<lb n="10"/>by mir unnd volgenden lanndtvoegten, in der lanndt=
<lb n="11"/>graffschafft <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-103" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Thurgöw</placeName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moegend</unclear> zugelassen werden,
<lb n="12"/>syen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gutwillig</unclear> die Kilchmennin in disem erbfal,
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">minder</unclear> dann die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üweren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hinzulassen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zůkumen</unclear>,
<lb n="14"/>hab ich der lenge nach <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verstanden</unclear>, unnd wann <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soliches=</unclear>
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">red</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">handlung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ainn</unclear> abzug unnd nit ain erbfal <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">belangte</unclear>,
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waere</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">urpüttig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesin</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ains</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">urkündtlinß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwerem</unclear>
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begeren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemaeß</unclear> werden zelassen. Diewyl aber
<lb n="18"/>gemelter <persName resp="#ner">Kilchmeninn</persName> anvorderung ain erb, so
<lb n="19"/>in üwer stat gefallen, betrifft, so begert unnd ersucht
<lb n="20"/>sy die frow ouch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> man nit annderst, soeliches angeregts
<lb n="21"/>erb zůbezyhen, und zů irn handen zebringen, dann
<lb n="22"/>nach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lut</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wysung</unclear> unnd vermoeg üwers stat erbrechtens,
<lb n="23"/>wie dann nit allain by üch, sonnder ouch im <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-103" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Thurgöuw</unclear></placeName>,
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gmain</unclear> in allen land: unnd oberkaiten, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">der</unclear>
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">recht</unclear> unnd der bruch ist, das ain <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">yeder</unclear> sin <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">un=</unclear>
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verhindert</unclear>, nach recht unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gwonhait</unclear> des <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lanndts</unclear>
<lb n="27"/>oder der stadt, darinn der erbfal <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gefallen</unclear> ist, be=
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zücht</unclear> unnd zu sinen hannden bringt, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deßhalb</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_972_2940.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Und</unclear> wann nun sy die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Talckemmerin</unclear> sich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">überuß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weigerens</unclear>
<lb n="30"/>zu <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gemein</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">terecht</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erbutt</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">behelfft</unclear>, so gelangt
<lb n="31"/>an <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abermalen</unclear> min <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pitt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beger</unclear>, ir sy von irem
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zimlichen</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erberen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erbuten</unclear>. (Wie ich dann <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hofft</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">on</unclear>-
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lög</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beschechen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werde</unclear>) <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">tringen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sonnders</unclear> sy <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">darby</unclear>,
<lb n="34"/>(wie ich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vormal</unclear> gegen den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üweren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geneigt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wäre</unclear>)
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beliben</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">iro</unclear> zu dem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">das</unclear> ir von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">billicheit</unclear>
<lb n="36"/>wegen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gehört</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürderlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verhelffen</unclear>. Das beger
<lb n="37"/>ich, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unßlid</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sundern</unclear> das es <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">siner</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">billich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">genüsthab</unclear>,
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zu</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beschulden</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Dath</unclear> <origDate resp="#ner">uff sant Simon unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Judas</unclear>
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">appostelorum</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abend</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">a°</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">d</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lj</unclear></origDate>.
<lb n="40"/><persName role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ludwig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Tschudj</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Glarus</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lanndt</unclear>-
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vogt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ober</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nider</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-103" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Thurgöw</unclear></placeName>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_972_2941.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_972_2942.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="42"/>Den frommen, vesten, fürsichtigen, ersamen,
<lb n="43"/>und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wisen</unclear>, <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Burgermeister</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> Rath
<lb n="44"/>der statt Sant Gallen</orgName>, minen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sonnders</unclear>
<lb n="45"/>günstigen lieben herren unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gutten</unclear> fründen.
</p>
